OL,3,GNEWSA'Learning to read in my 80s has
OL,4,Achanged my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old man said learning to
OL,7,Fread has enabled him to read his and
OL,8,Fhis wife's anniversary cards for the
OL,9,Ffirst time in 65 years.
OL,11,FAlan Hannay, from Dibden Purlieu,
OL,12,Flearned to read through the charity
OL,13,FRead Easy, which helps adults across
OL,14,Fthe country who struggle with the skill
OL,15,Fmany of us take for granted.
OL,17,FHannay told BBC Radio Solent: "It's
OL,18,Fchanged my whole life, my confidence,
OL,19,Fchanged my family life and everything
OL,20,Faround me.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
